 Open sessions are not held across view rendering (`spring.jpa.open-in-view` is disabled), so associations that a view needs are fetched eagerly at the mapping level.
 
+### Views
+
+Thymeleaf templates render every page. The veterinarian directory is the only list whose paging links carry a filter value.
+
+Those paging links are parameterized link expressions. Thymeleaf URL-encodes a value in that form — a space becomes `%20` — and renders a null-valued parameter as a bare `name=`. Each veterinarian paging link selects between a filtered and an unfiltered expression on a `th:with` flag. The unfiltered links are byte-identical to the ones the directory carried before filtering.
+
 ## Dependency Policy
 
